    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests that {@link UtcInstant#ofModifiedJulianDay} correctly constructs an instant at the very last nanosecond of the normal (non-leap) portion of a leap-second day. <p>1972-12-31 (MJD 41682) was a leap-second day, so its timeline looks like: <pre> 23:59:58 ... 23:59:59.999999999 &lt;- normal day (nanoOfDay = NANOS_PER_DAY - 1) 23:59:60.000000000 &lt;- leap second (nanoOfDay = NANOS_PER_DAY) </pre> This test verifies the boundary instant at {@code nanoOfDay = NANOS_PER_DAY - 1}: it must not be considered a leap second and must format as {@code 23:59:59.999999999Z}."
   },
